TITLE:: ProbeScope
summary:: Modernized oscilloscope wrapping native ScopeView with theme styling
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/Stethoscope

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeScope wraps SuperCollider's native ScopeView (powered by ScopeOut2 and shared-memory QcScopeShm) in an elegant, theme-consistent window with an overlaid transparent grid, multi-channel wave colors, and keyboard shortcuts.

Audio thread safety is strictly preserved: rendering uses the native shared-memory buffer path, adding zero additional audio DSP overhead.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Opens and returns a new ProbeScope window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server (must be a local server for shared-memory scoping).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio or control bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels to scope.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::, code::\phosphor::, code::\ice::, etc.).

ARGUMENT:: rate
code::\audio:: or code::\control::.

ARGUMENT:: style
Display mode: code::\tracks:: (stacked channels separated along the Y axis, default), code::\overlay:: (superimposed channels centered at zero), or code::\xy:: (Lissajous stereo).

ARGUMENT:: bufSize
Buffer size in frames (default: 4096).

ARGUMENT:: engine
Rendering engine: code::\smooth:: (default, antialiased vector renderer using Pen with thick sub-pixel lines) or code::\native:: (ScopeView shared-memory blit).

ARGUMENT:: lineWidth
Vector line stroke width in pixels when in code::\smooth:: engine (default 1.8).

ARGUMENT:: fill
Boolean indicating whether to fill the area between waveform and baseline with a translucent ribbon (default false).

METHOD:: view
Embed the oscilloscope into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Parent view or window.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Dimensions and position as link::Classes/Rect::.

ARGUMENT:: server
Target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio or control bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Visual theme.

ARGUMENT:: rate
code::\audio:: or code::\control::.

ARGUMENT:: style
Display style: code::\tracks:: (default), code::\overlay::, or code::\xy::.

ARGUMENT:: bufSize
Scope buffer size in frames.

ARGUMENT:: showToolbar
Boolean indicating whether to show top toolbar controls.

ARGUMENT:: engine
Rendering engine: code::\smooth:: (default) or code::\native::.

ARGUMENT:: lineWidth
Vector stroke width in pixels (default 1.8).

ARGUMENT:: fill
Boolean indicating whether to fill waveform area (default false).

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: scopeView
Returns the underlying PB_ScopeView composite view.

METHOD:: engine
Get or set the rendering engine (code::\smooth:: or code::\native::).

ARGUMENT:: aEngine
Symbol code::\smooth:: or code::\native::.

METHOD:: lineWidth
Get or set the vector line thickness in pixels.

ARGUMENT:: aWidth
Float line thickness (clamped to [0.5, 10.0]).

METHOD:: fill
Get or set translucent ribbon area fill.

ARGUMENT:: aFill
Boolean.

METHOD:: theme
Changes theme palette dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: scopeStyle
Switches display mode: code::\overlay::, code::\tracks::, or code::\xy::.

ARGUMENT:: aStyle
Style mode symbol.

METHOD:: yZoom
Adjusts vertical amplitude zoom.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float zoom factor.

METHOD:: xZoom
Adjusts horizontal time zoom.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float zoom factor.

METHOD:: cycle
Sets window frame cycle length.

ARGUMENT:: frames
Integer cycle frame size.

METHOD:: triggerMode
Sets the oscilloscope triggering mode.

ARGUMENT:: mode
Trigger mode: code::\free::, code::\rising::, or code::\falling::.

METHOD:: triggerThreshold
Sets the waveform trigger threshold level.

ARGUMENT:: val
Float threshold amplitude.

METHOD:: resetZoom
Resets both X and Y zoom factors to 1.0.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of oscilloscope updates.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: close
Closes window and frees ScopeBuffer and analysis Synth.

SECTION:: Keyboard Shortcuts
list::
## strong::+ / =::: Zoom in vertically
## strong::- / _::: Zoom out vertically
## strong::[ / ]::: Zoom time in / out
## strong::0 / r::: Reset zoom to 1.0x
## strong::e / E::: Toggle rendering engine between code::\smooth:: and code::\native::
## strong::f / F::: Toggle translucent ribbon fill
## strong::w / W::: Increase / decrease line stroke width (+/- 0.2)
## strong::t::: Cycle triggering mode (\free -> \rising -> \falling)
## strong::s::: Cycle through display styles (Tracks -> Overlay -> X/Y)
## strong::Spacebar::: Freeze / resume waveform drawing
::
